    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so messy. trying to \"find myself\" sounds so exhausting when all i can think about is the shame. everyone has this perfect image of me in their heads, and i'm just going to spend the rest of my life tarnishing it. wouldn't it just be cleaner if i just... stopped? if i didn't have to face the slow decline into being someone nobody's proud of anymore?",
